```

So I should use dynamic import too.

Let me also think about what models I need. From `./models` I get all the db exports. I need `faceEmbeddings` (the Sequelize model), `Delegate`, `ProgrammeDelegate`, `ScanEvent`, `user`, and the `sequelize` instance.

